      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7613107",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate the control room on the left",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761310701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761310701": {
            "id": "761310701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm? This thing looks like it still works.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310702"
            ]
          },
          "761310702": {
            "id": "761310702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Maybe there's some info inside? Let's open it up and take a look.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310703"
            ]
          },
          "761310703": {
            "id": "761310703",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is this the message that the creature from space sent to the dragons...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310704"
            ]
          },
          "761310704": {
            "id": "761310704",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Eggie",
            "text": "I see. So that's how it was...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310705"
            ]
          },
          "761310705": {
            "id": "761310705",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So Project Moongazer was meant to send this kind of message back out into the universe?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310706"
            ]
          },
          "761310706": {
            "id": "761310706",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If that's all there was to it, couldn't they just have used the Eye of Ibni-Belum?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310707"
            ]
          },
          "761310707": {
            "id": "761310707",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Did Paimon miss something? Hang on, she's gonna check again!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310708"
            ]
          },
          "761310708": {
            "id": "761310708",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh! Whaddya know, there really is a footnote at the end!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310709"
            ]
          },
          "761310709": {
            "id": "761310709",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"To my 'daughter,' Ninnin.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310710"
            ]
          },
          "761310710": {
            "id": "761310710",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ninnin!? Wait... So you're Lusalim's daughter, Eggie!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310711"
            ]
          },
          "761310711": {
            "id": "761310711",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wait, then how'd you end up like this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310712"
            ]
          },
          "761310712": {
            "id": "761310712",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Eggie",
            "text": "I... I don't know... I don't have these memories... Why don't I have them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310713"
            ]
          },
          "761310713": {
            "id": "761310713",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We need to go take a look at the moon's core.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310714"
            ]
          },
          "761310714": {
            "id": "761310714",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "B—But what about Columbina? We still haven't found any clues regarding her disappearance...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310715"
            ]
          },
          "761310715": {
            "id": "761310715",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That might also be connected to the moon's core.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310716"
            ]
          },
          "761310716": {
            "id": "761310716",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, right! That familiar feeling she mentioned earlier must be the core, right? Come on, let's check it out!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7613101",
      "subQuestName": "Investigate the device",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "761310901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "761310901": {
            "id": "761310901",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Can we turn off the security system with this?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310902"
            ]
          },
          "761310902": {
            "id": "761310902",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Eggie",
            "text": "That's right, these are the security controls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310903"
            ]
          },
          "761310903": {
            "id": "761310903",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Eggie",
            "text": "But it seems we need to shut down both the security controls here and in the room on the right — and we need to do it in quick succession.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310904"
            ]
          },
          "761310904": {
            "id": "761310904",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So that means once we turn the security system off here, we've gotta hurry over to the other control room as fast as we can, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "761310905"
            ]
          },
          "761310905": {
            "id": "761310905",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Understood."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7613108",
